    "name": "USB-BOT",
    "steam_appid": 3604130,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying 2D platform puzzle adventure in USB-BOT, where a small, disconnected USB sets out on a quest to reunite with the device it was once a part of. With its wire tail torn away, USB-BOT must navigate a world that suddenly feels immense and full of danger. As you traverse 2D environments filled with challenging puzzles and dynamic platforming elements, your mission is to help this determined little USB find its way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main adventure offers around 3 hours of gameplay, not including the time it takes to discover all the hidden secrets  scattered throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/75c5b771d73cbd79ef2171533647934e.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=535 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/75c5b771d73cbd79ef2171533647934e.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, move, and use items in creative ways to conquer puzzles and platforming challenges. Grab metal objects and place them cleverly to complete circuits, power devices, and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/3e5b27ea3c88ec8925c4927e055db0af.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=522 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/3e5b27ea3c88ec8925c4927e055db0af.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, collect hidden QR code fragments, and piece them together to unlock new levels.\u00a0As an extra challenge, find and reunite scattered USBC-BOTS hidden in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/06284e3fef26dc62c3e1b35012264982.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=417 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/06284e3fef26dc62c3e1b35012264982.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head isn\u2019t just for thinking \u2014 it\u2019s part of the puzzle!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying 2D platform puzzle adventure in USB-BOT, where a small, disconnected USB sets out on a quest to reunite with the device it was once a part of. With its wire tail torn away, USB-BOT must navigate a world that suddenly feels immense and full of danger. As you traverse 2D environments filled with challenging puzzles and dynamic platforming elements, your mission is to help this determined little USB find its way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main adventure offers around 3 hours of gameplay, not including the time it takes to discover all the hidden secrets  scattered throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/75c5b771d73cbd79ef2171533647934e.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=535 height=433 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/75c5b771d73cbd79ef2171533647934e.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, move, and use items in creative ways to conquer puzzles and platforming challenges. Grab metal objects and place them cleverly to complete circuits, power devices, and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/3e5b27ea3c88ec8925c4927e055db0af.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=522 height=435 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/3e5b27ea3c88ec8925c4927e055db0af.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore freely, collect hidden QR code fragments, and piece them together to unlock new levels.\u00a0As an extra challenge, find and reunite scattered USBC-BOTS hidden in each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/06284e3fef26dc62c3e1b35012264982.poster.avif?t=1755085268\" width=417 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604130/extras/06284e3fef26dc62c3e1b35012264982.webm?t=1755085268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your head isn\u2019t just for thinking \u2014 it\u2019s part of the puzzle!</p>",
